{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2022a.q38.material.recovered", "text": "体育教师王某对几个不喜欢上体育课也不参加体育锻炼的学生说：“体育锻炼对人体有好处。伏尔泰曾说‘生命在于运动’，希望你们能好好上体育课，积极参加体育锻炼。”但学生杨某却振振有词地说：“也有人认为不参加体育锻炼也能长寿，我曾经看到一张图（见图1）。图中反映出各种动物的心率与寿命之间的关系。老师，我认为运动后心率会增加，会缩短寿命。”又一位学生李某接着说：“老师，您能给我们说说体育锻炼有什么好处吗？”……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1c65fe2508b82cb7344d256962dc6cd5513b3edc08d9d391555cff44aad0bc80", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2986, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3187, "next_source_question_number": 39, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 38, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "1c65fe2508b82cb7344d256962dc6cd5513b3edc08d9d391555cff44aad0bc80"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2022a.q38"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k01", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k11"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.413.r003", "ntce.outline.413.r008", "ntce.outline.413.r011", "ntce.outline.413.r030"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2022a.q38"], "word_count": 201, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1c65fe2508b82cb7344d256962dc6cd5513b3edc08d9d391555cff44aad0bc80", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 2986, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3187, "next_source_question_number": 39, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 38, "alignment_status": "pend