{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2022a.q39.material.recovered", "text": "某高中举行田径运动会，学生李某参加了100米和110米栏两项比赛。在100米跑的决赛中获得了冠军，在110米栏比赛中仅获得第五名。为此李某非常困惑，两项运动都是靠速度取胜，比赛成绩为何有如此大的差异呢?赛后，老师告诉他：你的过程动作有点慢，是在“跳栏”而不是“跑栏”，并且在过程后落地迈步较小，还有明显停顿感……", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1c65fe2508b82cb7344d256962dc6cd5513b3edc08d9d391555cff44aad0bc80", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3254, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3410, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 39, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "1c65fe2508b82cb7344d256962dc6cd5513b3edc08d9d391555cff44aad0bc80"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2022a.q39"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s1.k04", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s3.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design", "ntce.gaozhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.413.r005", "ntce.outline.413.r012", "ntce.outline.413.r018", "ntce.outline.413.r019", "ntce.outline.413.r026", "ntce.outline.413.r027"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2022a.q39"], "word_count": 156, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1c65fe2508b82cb7344d256962dc6cd5513b3edc08d9d391555cff44aad0bc80", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3254, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3410, "next_source_question_number": 40, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "quest