{"material_id": "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2022a.q40.material.recovered", "text": "某高中举行田径运动会，学生李某参加了100米和110米栏两项比赛。在100米跑的决赛中获得了冠军，在110米栏比赛中仅获得第五名。为此李某非常困惑，两项运动都是靠速度取胜，比赛成绩为何有如此大的差异呢?赛后，老师告诉他：你的过程动作有点慢，是在“跳栏”而不是“跑栏”，并且在过程后落地迈步较小，还有明显停顿感……40（1）针对学生李某的困感，分析100米和100米栏两个项目的技术特点。（9分）（2）请给出3种纠正李某“跳栏”错误动作的练习方法。（6分）四、教学设计题。教学设计题（本大题共1小题，共20分）", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1c65fe2508b82cb7344d256962dc6cd5513b3edc08d9d391555cff44aad0bc80", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3254, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3508, "next_source_question_number": 41, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 40, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "1c65fe2508b82cb7344d256962dc6cd5513b3edc08d9d391555cff44aad0bc80"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2022a.q40"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s3.k02", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s3.k03", "ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.s3.k04"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.gaozhong.ability.design"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.413.r018", "ntce.outline.413.r019", "ntce.outline.413.r021", "ntce.outline.413.r023", "ntce.outline.413.r027", "ntce.outline.413.r028"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.gaozhong.tiyu.2022a.q40"], "word_count": 254, "level": "gaozhong", "subject": "tiyu", "kind": "lesson_plan_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/高中真题/2022年上半年教师资格证考试《高中体育与健康》题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "1c65fe2508b82cb7344d256962dc6cd5513b3edc08d9d391555cff44aad0bc80", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3254, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3508, "next_source_question_number": 41, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section